sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Client
  participant G as Nginx / API Gateway
  participant A as Auth Service
  participant O as Orders Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant N as NATS
  participant T as Temporal
  participant P as Payments Service
  participant I as Inventory Service
  participant S as Moto S3
  participant D as Dagster

  C->>G: POST /orders
  G->>A: validate caller
  A-->>G: authenticated identity
  G->>O: forward request and identity
  O->>DB: insert order and outbox event in one transaction
  DB-->>O: commit
  O-->>C: order response

  par NATS publication
    O->>DB: claim pending event
    O->>N: publish and flush
    O->>DB: mark published
  and Raw data export
    O->>S: write deterministic JSONL object
    O->>DB: record export result
  and Workflow dispatch
    O->>T: start deterministic workflow
  end

  T->>O: run workflow activities
  O->>P: charge or refund over HTTP
  O->>I: reserve inventory over HTTP
  T->>O: confirm or cancel order
  D->>S: read raw events
  D->>S: write curated Parquet
